findings.remediation:
Add a google_pubsub_topic_iam_member resource to the module:

resource "google_pubsub_topic_iam_member" "pike_publisher" {
  topic  = google_pubsub_topic.pike.id
  role   = "roles/pubsub.publisher"
  member = "serviceAccount:${google_service_account.pike.email}"
}

Change the variable declaration in variables.tf to accept the KMS key object:

variable "key" {
  type = object({
    id = string
  })
  description = "KMS CryptoKey resource used for CMEK encryption"
  validation {
    condition     = length(trim(var.key.id)) > 0
    error_message = "The key id must not be empty."
  }
}

Fix the output reference in outputs.tf:

output "repository" {
  description = "The source repository"
  value       = google_sourcerepo_repository.pike
}
